        "slc_35a0d64398e308429891acaa0e360b817519d270ce4b75ce9596d2152fa368ef"
      ],
      "text": "The v2 design spec extends the refinement loop with pluggable evaluation, multi-file workspace targets, expanded ASI, and background constraints; all additions are opt-in and default behavior matches v1."
    },
    {
