      ],
      "text": "The plugin ships one skill (simmer) with four subskills running the loop: Setup (identify artifact, elicit criteria), Generator (improve from ASI), Judge (score 1-10 per criterion, produce ASI), and Reflect (record trajectory, track best candidate)."
    },
