      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_9ee7e66b61bb12eab29a55bfa9bf4b75e01f4bec63692cc4ff6b3fad17db44f7"
      ],
      "text": "Context isolation is a stated design principle: the generator does not see scores and the judge does not see previous scores, so each role gets only the context it needs to avoid bias."
    },
